    "text": "This program only delivers gifts whose recipients are within range D of Lapland. The sleigh never moves, so each such gift is loaded and delivered immediately from the base. All the rules are satisfied because there are no accelerations or floats. Gifts further than D from (0,0) are skipped. I did not implement any movement planning, so the score is only the sum of the scores of those nearby gifts.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){\n    long long T,D,W,G;\n    cin>>T>>D>>W>>G;\n    for(int i=0;i<W;i++){long long a,b;cin>>a>>b;}\n    vector<string> out;\n    for(int i=0;i<G;i++){\n        string n;long long s,w,c,r;\n        cin>>n>>s>>w>>c>>r;\n        if(c*c+r*r<=D*D){\n            out.push_back(\"LoadGift \"+n);\n            out.push_back(\"DeliverGift \"+n);\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%zu\\n\",out.size());\n    for(auto&s:out)printf(\"%s\\n\",s.c_str());\n}\n```",
